  "description": "Long-range value. Everyday ready.\n\nDesigned to provide the ultimate convenience and performance, our battery features a removable dual-module design and equipped with the best Samsung cells. With a massive 52V28Ah capacity, you can cruise all-day long and go the extra mile with confidence\n\nChoose your color and ride in style with our Bullets, available in black and green. Go classic with black or make a statement with green.\n\nConquer any terrain with Bullet GT's motorcycle-grade hydraulic suspension. No need to worry about bumps or cracks. The suspension is also adjustable with rebound controlandlockout to fit your riding needs.\n\nSafety is our top priority. Our bikes are certified with UL, one of the highest safety standards in the industry. In addition, we've tested our bike frame over 300,000 times in the toughest conditions with a 330 lbs. weight. (We also have product liability insurance to give you added peace of mind.)",
